: "com.WellsStudios.WellsTaggers-20241101-175727.png", "id": "1630611974467428", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75411988_1630611977800761_7635821973011666471_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dTF6LoR_WwUQ7kNvwEN6Ddf&_nc_oc=Adl0En7qPiLm1CC_KC80o1rWPhzCbBZYhleIqeW96auCceDouPyYQmTDII_U9ADYfzM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afuq3Jj99_t7fuZdetSoxvN9-u7H0u7pjmfHlQVJPxn_pQ&oe=69A6BF2E"}, {"file_name": "com.WellsStudios.WellsTaggers-20241101-175713.png", "id": "549067324527740", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210389_549067327861073_2529266429934636058_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MMI1ar542y4Q7kNvwEmxc4w&_nc_oc=AdlrlUGZ69SLfh8yFkr0tLgS_3KU1GCqf3G-nldDE_9fSoZzix4N9PHs_bkdv4qgWgM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aftr5ZFge7SeErA_pWcbShB5mV7Ai6kunUTbO502oMq7kw&oe=69A6DAFB"}, {"file_name": "com.WellsStudios.WellsTaggers-20241101-175750.png", "id": "1233285141120740", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974456_1233285144454073_4577451540501517425_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Mj9UQvI-QZoQ7kNvwFFnM8C&_nc_oc=Adn5CZ_HiFyYksxTDfgJuO2h6hdYgziYazBZh_F7p27kg-MmKRra9BMDijGKEw2LOak&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afucrk7o721zeRRBSSDJRhHS63FxDc-eg9YGXnIMKSJS-Q&oe=69A6E08F"}, {"file_name": "com.WellsStudios.WellsTaggers-20241101-175810 (1).png", "id": "1549630812590254", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984460_1549630815923587_3757692530628789073_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=S4xryadNOnwQ7kNvwFwLQm7&_nc_oc=Adl_3VZGYMB3FkWe0tvoIUJUpxMgDqGD6_BpmlFqrNBZCCgevRK_k81TjsByxULVb3o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftfbUZfQkiQwxuCqucWAhpOjp_L-vPlCOAr8pwmHawXQQ&oe=69A6D8A3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wells Taggers", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Overview\nWells Taggers is an exhilarating, fast-paced multiplayer game where players engage in the classic playground game of tag within a vibrant, interactive Roblox world. Inspired by the timeless fun of \"Gorilla Tag,\" this game takes the simple concept of tag and elevates it with dynamic environments, diverse characters, and unique abilities.\n\nGameplay\nObjective:\nPlayers are divided into two teams: Taggers and Runners. The Taggers' goal is to chase and tag all the Runners before the timer runs out. Runners must avoid being tagged and use the environment and power-ups to outmaneuver the Taggers.\n\nGame Modes:\n\nClassic Tag: Traditional tag mode where Taggers must tag all Runners to win.\nInfected Tag: Tagged players become Taggers, spreading the infection until only one Runner remains.\nFreeze Tag: Tagged players are frozen in place until a teammate unfreezes them. Taggers win by freezing all players.\nMaps:\n\nUrban Playground: Navigate through a bustling cityscape with rooftops, alleys, and parks.\nEnchanted Forest: A magical forest filled with hiding spots and mystical creatures.\nSpace Station: A futuristic environment with zero-gravity zones and space-themed obstacles.\nPower-Ups:\n\n\n", "short_description": "Overview\nWells Taggers is an exhilarating, fast-paced multiplayer game where players engage in the classic playground game of tag within a vibrant, interactive Roblox world. Inspired by the timeless fun of \"Gorilla Tag,\" this game takes the simple concept of tag and elevates it with dynamic environments, diverse characters, and unique abilities.\n\nGameplay\nObjective:\nPlayers are divided into two teams: Taggers and Runners. The Taggers' goal is to chase and tag all the Runners before the timer."}]}, "developer_name": "Wells_VR", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/wellstaggersprivacypolicy/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Wells_VR", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/wellstaggers